      "widgets_values": [
        "A bright, energetic portrait of a young woman standing on a professional indoor basketball court, captured in a warm, cinematic style that combines lifestyle photography with sports culture. The scene is set inside a large arena, with rows of empty spectator seats fading softly into the background under atmospheric arena lighting. At the centre of the court, a basketball hoop and backboard are visible behind her, slightly blurred by shallow depth of field, helping to draw attention to the subject in the foreground.\n\nThe woman stands confidently on the polished hardwood floor of the court, leaning slightly forward in a relaxed, playful pose while holding a basketball in one hand. Her posture conveys casual athletic confidence rather than competitive intensity, as if she has just paused between shots during a friendly game. Her arm rests naturally on the basketball, which she grips lightly near her hip, the familiar orange texture of the ball contrasting against the smooth wooden court.\n\nShe has long, wavy blonde hair that falls past her shoulders, styled naturally with soft movement and subtle highlights catching the warm arena lights. A few loose strands frame her face, enhancing the relaxed and approachable feeling of the image. Her expression is bright and cheerful, with a wide, genuine smile that shows confidence and enthusiasm. Her eyes appear lively and engaged, looking directly toward the camera, creating a strong connection with the viewer.\n\nHer outfit blends casual modern fashion with a sporty atmosphere. She wears a fitted light blue short-sleeve crop top what has the words \"JIB\" in white writing on the front,  the focus to remain on her expression and posture while still emphasising an athletic silhouette. The crop top reveals a small portion of her midriff, giving the look a contemporary lifestyle aesthetic often seen in sports fashion photography.\n\nShe pairs the top with high-waisted blue denim jeans, which add a relaxed everyday style to the image. The jeans fit comfortably while still appearing stylish and modern, balancing the sporty setting with casual fashion. The contrast between denim and the basketball court environment creates a visual blend of street style and sports culture.\n\nIn her hand, she holds a basketball with a visible brand logo printed on the surface. The textured rubber of the ball catches the overhead lighting, showing subtle highlights along its curved surface. The ball appears slightly worn, suggesting it has been used in real play rather than being purely decorative.\n\nThe basketball court itself is highly polished, reflecting soft light from the arena above. The light wooden floorboards form repeating geometric patterns that lead the viewer’s eye toward the hoop in the background. Painted court lines curve across the floor in dark contrasting colours, reinforcing the sense of location and scale.\n\nBehind her, the basketball hoop and backboard are positioned centrally in the frame but remain softly out of focus due to the shallow depth of field. The rim, net, and backboard structure create a recognisable sports setting while ensuring the woman remains the primary focal point of the image. High above the hoop, arena lights glow warmly, producing a cinematic bokeh effect that adds depth and atmosphere.\n\nThe arena seating rises behind the court in rows of dark chairs, mostly empty, giving the impression that the scene was captured during practice or before a game. The background lighting features warm amber and soft red tones that complement the colour of the basketball and the wooden floor.\n\nOverall, the image conveys a lively, youthful energy that blends sports culture, casual fashion, and confident personality. The composition emphasises natural expression, relaxed body language, and a bright arena environment, creating a modern lifestyle sports portrait that feels both polished and authentic."
      ],
